---
// Normal mode vs agent Code Mode vs CLI CodeMode. Inline SVG, theme tokens only.
---
<figure class="pd" aria-labelledby="pd-cap">
	<div class="pd-scroll" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Diagram, scroll horizontally on small screens"><svg viewBox="0 0 1010 310" role="img" aria-labelledby="pd-title pd-desc">
		<title id="pd-title">Normal mode, agent Code Mode and CLI CodeMode</title>
		<desc id="pd-desc">Three ways an agent does the same three aos actions. Normal mode: three tool calls, each starting aos. Agent Code Mode: one JavaScript program whose three shell calls still start aos three times. CLI CodeMode: one program sent to aos code run, one process calling three registered operations and returning one JSON value.</desc>
		<defs>
			<marker id="pd-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="pd-fill-muted"/></marker>
		</defs>
		{[
			{ x: 0, title: '1. Normal mode', sub: '3 tool calls, 3 processes', agent: ['agent', '3 calls', 'in turn'] },
			{ x: 340, title: '2. Agent Code Mode', sub: '1 JS program, 3 processes', agent: ['agent', 'JS program', '$`aos` ×3'] },
		].map((pn) => (
			<g>
				<text x={pn.x + 10} y="22" class="pd-h">{pn.title}</text>
				<text x={pn.x + 10} y="40" class="pd-sub">{pn.sub}</text>
				<rect x={pn.x + 10} y="56" width="78" height="232" rx="8" class="pd-agent"/>
				<text x={pn.x + 49} y="160" class="pd-lbl" text-anchor="middle">{pn.agent[0]}</text>
				<text x={pn.x + 49} y="180" class="pd-tiny" text-anchor="middle">{pn.agent[1]}</text>
				<text x={pn.x + 49} y="195" class="pd-tiny" text-anchor="middle">{pn.agent[2]}</text>
				{['window move', 'brightness', 'open'].map((cmd, i) => {
					const y = 62 + i * 78;
					return (
						<g class={`pd-proc pd-d${i}`}>
							<path d={`M${pn.x + 88} ${y + 30} H${pn.x + 116}`} class="pd-edge" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)"/>
							<rect x={pn.x + 120} y={y} width="196" height="60" rx="7" class="pd-box"/>
							<rect x={pn.x + 130} y={y + 11} width="42" height="16" rx="3" class="pd-boot"/>
							<text x={pn.x + 151} y={y + 23} class="pd-tiny" text-anchor="middle">start</text>
							<rect x={pn.x + 176} y={y + 11} width="42" height="16" rx="3" class="pd-boot"/>
							<text x={pn.x + 197} y={y + 23} class="pd-tiny" text-anchor="middle">parse</text>
							<rect x={pn.x + 222} y={y + 11} width="86" height="16" rx="3" class="pd-op"/>
							<text x={pn.x + 265} y={y + 23} class="pd-tiny pd-tiny-op pd-cmd" text-anchor="middle">{cmd}</text>
							<text x={pn.x + 130} y={y + 47} class="pd-mono">aos {['window', 'display', 'open'][i]} …</text>
							<text x={pn.x + 308} y={y + 47} class="pd-tiny" text-anchor="end">text out</text>
						</g>
					);
				})}
			</g>
		))}
		<line x1="333" y1="54" x2="333" y2="290" class="pd-div"/>
		<line x1="673" y1="54" x2="673" y2="290" class="pd-div"/>

		<text x="690" y="22" class="pd-h">3. CLI CodeMode</text>
		<text x="690" y="40" class="pd-sub">1 program, 1 process</text>
		<rect x="690" y="56" width="78" height="232" rx="8" class="pd-agent"/>
		<text x="729" y="160" class="pd-lbl" text-anchor="middle">agent</text>
		<text x="729" y="180" class="pd-tiny" text-anchor="middle">1 program</text>
		<path d="M768 172 H796" class="pd-edge" marker-end="url(#pd-arrow)"/>
		<rect x="800" y="62" width="204" height="220" rx="9" class="pd-box pd-one"/>
		<rect x="812" y="76" width="42" height="16" rx="3" class="pd-boot"/>
		<text x="833" y="88" class="pd-tiny" text-anchor="middle">start</text>
		<rect x="858" y="76" width="92" height="16" rx="3" class="pd-boot"/>
		<text x="904" y="88" class="pd-tiny" text-anchor="middle">check program</text>
		<text x="812" y="116" class="pd-mono">aos code run -</text>
		<text x="812" y="136" class="pd-tiny">Promise.all, in-process</text>
		{['window-move', 'display-brightness', 'open'].map((op, i) => (
			<g class={`pd-par pd-d${i}`}>
				<rect x="812" y={148 + i * 28} width="180" height="20" rx="4" class="pd-op"/>
				<text x="822" y={162 + i * 28} class="pd-tiny pd-tiny-op">ops["{op}"]</text>
			</g>
		))}
		<text x="812" y="266" class="pd-tiny pd-ok">one JSON value back</text>
	</svg></div>
	<figcaption id="pd-cap">Same three actions. In normal mode the agent makes three tool calls and aos starts three times. Agent Code Mode cuts the tool calls to one program, but each <code>$`aos …`</code> in it still starts aos. CLI CodeMode sends one program to the CLI: one start, one checked program, operations called in parallel inside the process.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.pd { margin: 0; }
	.pd-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
	.pd svg { width: 100%; min-width: 960px; height: auto; display: block; }
	.pd-cmd { font-size: 9.5px; }
	.pd-h { font: 600 13px var(--cc-sans); fill: var(--cc-text); }
	.pd-sub { font: 500 11px var(--cc-mono); fill: var(--cc-text-3); }
	.pd-lbl { font: 600 13px var(--cc-sans); fill: var(--cc-text-2); }
	.pd-mono { font: 500 12px var(--cc-mono); fill: var(--cc-text); }
	.pd-tiny { font: 500 10.5px var(--cc-mono); fill: var(--cc-text-3); }
	.pd-tiny-op { fill: var(--cc-text); }
	.pd-ok { fill: var(--cc-ok); font-weight: 600; }
	.pd-agent { fill: var(--cc-bg-sunk); stroke: var(--cc-line-strong); }
	.pd-box { fill: var(--cc-bg-raised); stroke: var(--cc-line-strong); }
	.pd-one { stroke: var(--cc-accent); stroke-width: 1.5; }
	.pd-boot { fill: none; stroke: var(--cc-line-strong); stroke-dasharray: 3 2; }
	.pd-op { fill: var(--cc-accent-soft); stroke: var(--cc-accent); stroke-opacity: 0.55; }
	.pd-edge { stroke: var(--cc-text-3); stroke-width: 1.3; fill: none; }
	.pd-fill-muted { fill: var(--cc-text-3); }
	.pd-div { stroke: var(--cc-line); stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
	figcaption { margin-top: 0.9rem; font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--cc-text-3); line-height: 1.55; }

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
		.pd-proc, .pd-par { animation: pd-in 0.5s ease-out both; }
		.pd-d1 { animation-delay: 0.12s; }
		.pd-d2 { animation-delay: 0.24s; }
		@keyframes pd-in { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
	}
</style>
